.DS_Store
# Gradle build output: the build directory of the root project and of every project one level down (app,
# build-logic, a future e2e) or two (core/*, feature/*, build-logic/convention). Anchored, because a bare "build/"
# also ignores any source package, resource or asset folder named build (com.bittool.signer.build once never reached
# the repository). Sources always sit deeper, under <project>/src/.
/build/
/*/build/
/*/*/build/
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
.kotlin/
*.keystore
*.jks
!debug.keystore
secrets.properties
.claude/
